                <ui:Comment sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="483.2,420.8" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_1" Text="// On 29/8/2025 has been experienced an issue, which led to a non expected termination of the automation. The issue concerns the &quot;Δελτίο Παραγγελίας&quot; 0123-07062 &amp; 0123-07074 &amp; 0123-07388. The issue can been reproduced as described below: &#xA;In cases that the &quot;Πρακτικό Παραλαβής&quot; has been uploaded, but not the &quot;Δελτίο Παραγγελίας&quot;, then if the order lifecycle has been concluded, the late uploading of the &quot;Δελτίο Παραγγελίας&quot; is rejected with the message &quot;Δεν μπορείτε να επισεινάψετε το Δελτίο Παραγγελίας σε αυτή την κατάσταση παραγγελίας&quot;. The issue could have been avoided if the application would not allow the uploading of the &quot;Πρακτικό Παραλαβής&quot; in case the &quot;Δελτίο Παραγγελίας&quot; is not uploaded. The issue has been communicated to the application owner. A solution is expected." />
